The checked-in scripts/patches/0002-flowsteward-key-value-safety.patch disables
automatic Redis command retries, preserves missing values as null, surfaces
command errors and supports TLS hostname verification for pinned endpoint IPs.
Only Redis source and tool packages are registered. The build script, patch
and exact source/build pins accompany this package; binary SHA256 and sizes
are recorded in toolbox-provenance.json and SHA256SUMS.
